OL,5,
OL,6,FA housekeeper stole jewellery including
OL,7,Fa custom sapphire and diamond ring from
OL,8,Fthe Belgravia home of a Jordanian
OL,9,Fprincess before some of the items were
OL,10,Fauctioned for thousands of pounds, a
OL,11,Fcourt has heard.
OL,13,FMaria Virgelina Taborda Henao, 71,
OL,14,Fdenies stealing various items of
OL,15,Fjewellery, including a wedding ring,
OL,16,Ffrom her former employer Princess
OL,17,FFiryal Irshaid.
