OL,3,GNEWSAHousekeeper stole princess's
OL,4,Ajewels, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaborda Henao is accused of taking the
OL,7,Fitems from the princess's home in
OL,8,Fcentral London, on or before 26
OL,9,FNovember 2020, Southwark Crown Court
OL,10,Fwas told.
OL,12,FProsecution barrister Oliver Wellings
OL,13,Fsaid some of the items allegedly stolen
OL,14,Fwere sold at auctions by the
OL,15,Fdefendant's nephew, whom he said acted
OL,16,Fas a "key conduit" for their sale.
